      "text": "⚠️ Claude is a space to think | Anthropic \\ Anthropic - \u003ca href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-is-a-space-to-think\"\u003ehttps://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-is-a-space-to-think\u003c/a\u003e"
